                <p class="section-intro"><span class="company-label">RTO+P, 2010&ndash;2024.</span> I joined as a developer, was promoted to tech lead and then technology director, and went on to lead the agency's digital experience and technology practice, managing the design and engineering teams that delivered it. I was the senior technical voice in pitches and client work, on campaign platforms, ecommerce, branded social products, and experiments with AR and other emerging technology.</p>
                <p class="client-list">NBCUniversal, the Philadelphia 76ers, Bethesda Softworks, Under Armour, Planet Fitness, NFL Films, Sheetz, Swarovski, Stanley Black+Decker, Dietz &amp; Watson, Sparkling Ice, Visit Philadelphia, Drexel University, Rival Bros., and Honeysuckle Provisions.</p>
